{
  "id": "224-kent-home-finale",
  "locale": "cs",
  "kind": "long",
  "glossarySHA256": "cb0b94baf37d83f13a5401acdc21e0c6ef37e2bfd7c91616b1db7ae966dc2161",
  "reviewNote": "Full package was previously reviewed. Rechecked Kent Thu6 against English: the past counterfactual is restored with tehdy; all markers and other rows unchanged.",
  "rows": [
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Tue2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Things haven't changed much since I've been gone.#$e#Except that we have a new farmer in town.$h",
      "translation": "Za tu dobu, co jsem byl pryč, se toho moc nezměnilo.#$e#Až na to, že se ve městě objevila nová tvář z farmy.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "1fccc1e89561787f612f8d2d85be9c45433aa5510e7279e8cac2356b1a0af4b1",
      "translationSHA256": "6025417157f07761f96b5ad37fc52e36fef533c43e2b1b1341df51ed717f696c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Tue6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I feel like I'm settling back in pretty well. It's nice to have a friend in town.$h",
      "translation": "Mám pocit, že si na život doma zase docela dobře zvykám. Je příjemné mít ve městě někoho, s kým si člověk rozumí.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "ae52b998806f346c88674b0147f0d40aa556db100d1d0236b856ecf18bec1cfa",
      "translationSHA256": "161880f59459b0d095df7eea75b2b2b0269642c02e763bfe4dac66feb7cab287",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Wed6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "...I lost a lot of friends in battle.$s#$e#What's sad is that I can't even remember their faces.#$e#...",
      "translation": "...V boji jsem ztratil mnoho přátel.$s#$e#Nejsmutnější je, že si ani nedokážu vybavit jejich tváře.#$e#...",
      "sourceSHA256": "860318e88ecda85cde6b83fec3bbbd4ebc1b660f6545592210eaa45052fc2136",
      "translationSHA256": "272ea3b731f5211d3390d77f8352943c53af6b5b87306ea2074f4aac505a4a2b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You've been here a while now, haven't you? Your farm must be thriving.",
      "translation": "Už jsi tu nějakou dobu, viď? Tvé farmě se určitě daří.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c3064668bac8257eae6dbf2781a9736dacba1b8bf42ac3908f34c7092ddcf566",
      "translationSHA256": "34426e93c707ea47b2848ca5b3f8f1769fbf7beb48789c8f41100e4d70fba812",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Wed10",
      "field": null,
      "source": "To be alive is a special gift, and it comes and goes in the blink of an eye... never lose sight of that.",
      "translation": "Život je vzácný dar a může zmizet v jediném okamžiku... Nikdy na to nezapomínej.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5e6dc6bd5cb3eed2ae8d8398d7117bf99ca7a493fa10c7ecf425ed49e616b12e",
      "translationSHA256": "1b26e22076fc10bda29d60753f3e0eb4064c3b7b97c3e82baa4ab036ead1ac5e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Thu6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "#$1 Kent1#I've been up since 4 o'clock... sometimes I wonder if I'll ever get back into a normal routine.$k#$e#Sam has really grown up since I left. He's a man now.#$e#I wish I could've been there for him.$s",
      "translation": "#$1 Kent1#Jsem vzhůru už od čtyř hodin... Někdy přemýšlím, jestli se vůbec někdy vrátím k normálnímu režimu.$k#$e#Sam za dobu mé nepřítomnosti opravdu dospěl. Teď je z něj muž.#$e#Kéž bych tu pro něj tehdy mohl být.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "a6143e24e9d050d7d284ff3f07973a9c691d1b66010842c768f05a37c71478d8",
      "translationSHA256": "90e18b99e22a87a774b4215959ebf0385999aa48c693f33e75c7d300fd0be46d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Are you friends with my son?#$e#You probably know him better than I do...$s",
      "translation": "Přátelíš se s mým synem?#$e#Nejspíš ho znáš lépe než já...$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "31c4825ea3e786cc373a8dfede60e2fa81e79da36501cb50513adeba0768782a",
      "translationSHA256": "0810681b16b083805d6dfa77e9b2f50a8afdc5a47430ff3eb7db47c87ae641c9",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Thu_inlaw_Sam",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, @. Are you enjoying the married lifestyle?",
      "translation": "Ahoj, @. Jak se ti líbí manželský život?",
      "sourceSHA256": "6e45f74d83578b80b3780ee856d7f2dcaaf5b43d97c66aea37e2d737c99e53c6",
      "translationSHA256": "7713e83114da108935d822d52f4e2ac208ca824f71f475633d31232ef985b6d4",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It looks like a decent day for fishing, doesn't it?",
      "translation": "Vypadá to na docela dobrý den k rybaření, nemyslíš?",
      "sourceSHA256": "067294fc8f7c679a799d23c14541702fce84c37a46f255d57a0be8fc0eed38f6",
      "translationSHA256": "ba3c1f4cccd642f07c29612efb8e282deba2018c06136e011601ae79eb752d3e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Fri4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I oughta take up fishing. It would give me something to do, keep my hands busy.",
      "translation": "Měl bych začít rybařit. Alespoň bych měl co dělat a zaměstnal bych ruce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "2f68890c6c4a0a3fea344a0e93694ca4e592fbabf32e2f348190318a0ef4a7aa",
      "translationSHA256": "b9c8e46b5a11f3f1aa72fef3d3900b740021202e52154f7b2cc93c3277ace270",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Jodi tells me you've really become a part of this community. I'm glad to hear it.",
      "translation": "Jodi mi říká, že už doopravdy patříš k této komunitě. To rád slyším.",
      "sourceSHA256": "7b0275f281215307362f52fef7886b8a47cfd995c1586e200b7539bba1c79894",
      "translationSHA256": "dd98a0fe1dc81a10b8a42bcb30d35976b96fcee9d18d21327b3470ccdc6ae752",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Sat8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I have trouble sleeping, so please excuse me if I seem tired.#$e#I'm sure you can understand.",
      "translation": "Mívám potíže se spaním, tak mi prosím promiň, jestli působím unaveně.#$e#Určitě to dokážeš pochopit.",
      "sourceSHA256": "ca6e05b82246f32136ad073b284c4a5272a9bba69f1d5b9709aa622a500ed975",
      "translationSHA256": "acc9213b2078a36cf6ea4f421ec672e837b8ee9caaf8d6ee453fcc140319fbf1",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I don't know what to do with myself now that I'm back.#$e#I'm used to having more structure in my day.",
      "translation": "Teď, když jsem zpátky, nevím, co si se sebou počít.#$e#Jsem zvyklý na pevnější denní řád.",
      "sourceSHA256": "210a7f5921042a6ae866d29c62293a09e8b1a116caeb9d914d20deaf5370afec",
      "translationSHA256": "6e4c1f8a3a74ed042f55b8739c38ba1c744d125c2ca2776f45f23413aaca4132",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "Sun4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You've got a routine to keep you busy, huh? That's a good thing.#$e#Too much freedom can be stifling. We all benefit from having some structure in our lives.",
      "translation": "Máš svůj režim, který tě zaměstnává, viď? To je dobře.#$e#Příliš mnoho svobody může člověka dusit. Trocha řádu v životě prospívá nám všem.",
      "sourceSHA256": "9eac12f814b04e02d25c0a2af603dd091dd647ae66062f994309594888bea8be",
      "translationSHA256": "5d7850b06fc4fd7b4787eac17a5bcd10ce458e1111486c820ab8306f7ddd9b20",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "event_popcorn1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You keep quiet! Stop trying to turn me against my wife.$u",
      "translation": "Mlč! Přestaň se mě snažit poštvat proti vlastní ženě.$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "4231aee7a23e55578f001c7eacf89a4ed220e83f85d5c16f197b5c0f58455a19",
      "translationSHA256": "f9214eeb5d307d475c9e3744f511a580edb71de15962a1a41574aa871c4b42ec",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "event_popcorn2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "...$s#$b#You're absolutely right, @.$s",
      "translation": "...$s#$b#Máš naprostou pravdu, @.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "ea162a0d9467076611a2ee887b87a7ae56eddd88b33526f42b7ca3d414983cb5",
      "translationSHA256": "5cefa0a1de92d73cdf7f2dc18c0b225ace55c0499d422e39e9e7016a0a521e98",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Kent",
      "key": "event_popcorn3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't lie to me! I hate lies more than anything!$u",
      "translation": "Nelži mi! Lži nenávidím ze všeho nejvíc!$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "afe15c0575854eff48e3d8e253435203106ddb76da8b43c6da42fcd1d274b4d7",
      "translationSHA256": "f914e91fd6eadb415e255dfd07969efa083ee8d99ea75b5102ac87ff49c67dc8",
